  "title": "Card",
  "type": "component",
  "status": "stable",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Surface primitive for a discrete, self-contained item, not ordinary page sections. Default padding: PC (≥1024px) 16px, Mobile/Tablet 8px; 12px surface radius, no border or shadow. Native link/button hosts support single interactions; keep mixed actions inside a static Card. Child overflow remains visible; crop media separately.",
